-> Quick practice exercise:

    1. Run ip add and note your subnet.

    2. Run sudo netdiscover -i eth0 -r <your-subnet> -P.

    3. Identify each device by its MAC vendor. Do you recognize all of them?

    4. Try passive mode (-p) while opening a website on your phone, and watch how the device appears.

